foundation.solution_text:
The equation is in the form $y = \sqrt{r^2 - x^2}$ with $r^2 = 9$, so $r = 3$.
Orientation: upper semicircle.
Domain: $[-3, 3]$
Range: $[0, 3]$
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.8]
\draw[<->] (-4.2,0) -- (4.2,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[<->] (0,-1) -- (0,4.2) node[above] {$y$};
\foreach \x in {-3,-2,-1,1,2,3} {\draw (\x,0.1) -- (\x,-0.1);}
\foreach \y in {1,2,3} {\draw (0.1,\y) -- (-0.1,\y);}
\draw[thick, blue] (3,0) arc (0:180:3);
\fill (-3,0) circle (2.5pt) node[below left] {$(-3, 0)$};
\fill (3,0) circle (2.5pt) node[below right] {$(3, 0)$};
\fill (0,3) circle (2.5pt) node[above right] {$(0, 3)$};
\node[below left] at (0,0) {$O$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

